==Trivia== 
*'''To mobile players: You can't prestige if you're on a phone! Use tablet mode.'''
*As of July 26th, 2026, 14,572,419 players have received the offer to prestige based on the [https://www.roblox.com/badges/196200785/Level-100 Level 100 badge].
*There are no badges for reaching any prestige, including Prestige X.
*The old prestige icons were taken from [https://callofduty.fandom.com/wiki/Prestige_Mode#Call_of_Duty:_Ghosts Call of Duty: Ghosts].
*There is a common glitch, where the player reaches level 99 and finishes it, the game will reset your level to 1 with full XP. You will need to play through 2-3 rounds and then you will get the badge, go directly to level 100 and be eligible for prestige.

